{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"221d179cee158fff94c2236cf41885b53cbc0e36d7e6d95449ede592d97c035f","ja":"勃発、カラオケ対決！","zh":"爆发，卡拉OK对决！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b6a8d319232048a39a9207197f592acc3c2a17434de8dba9a85f38ba727f0d3a","ja":"今日の5人のお仕事は、バラエティ番組の出演。\nカラオケ対決をする、という内容で……","zh":"今天这5人的工作，是出演综艺节目。\n节目内容是进行卡拉OK对决……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f1d3efc1898e46cbe106490eb0527af8efab2e6dc43e3f7647bf631c0958a385","ja":"「みなさんには、番組が指定した楽曲を\n自己プロデュースして歌っていただきます！」","zh":"「请各位对节目指定的歌曲\n亲自企划并演唱！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"59bc67f5952fc155f5ac49d6e9bc15d28ba07b17684b3fbb6310517d2daedc10","ja":"歌うだけじゃなくて、演出を考えるのか。","zh":"不只是唱歌，还要考虑演出吗。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3aa263ebe53dc47c3a96b1a8249b09990332d20833037efe11f0a1ae0d6227fb","ja":"面白そうかも！\nソロライブを考えるみたいで、ワクワクするねっ！","zh":"好像会很有意思！\n就像在策划个人演唱会一样，让人好期待呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1aa81d7a5b0002d3c8fdadd425435cb133b20f1f57d9a5eced20097846ba244b","ja":"自分らしさをどう出すかが大事ってことだね。\nうふふっ、私、負けないよ～♪","zh":"就是说，关键是要展现出自己的风格吧。\n呵呵，我不会输的哦～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"6179785a5b7de69671a10dce19969cf3ab753b9b5207bb936a95e4dd2393ae09","ja":"ありさはもちろん、アイドルちゃんへの愛を\n全力で出しちゃいますよ！　ありさらしく！","zh":"当然要全力表达对偶像们的爱了！\n这才是亚利沙的风格！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"2621b15625d0f5b36ff0cbc500a16ffcc7c9ee9992231846cc334359ce735d80","ja":"亜利沙ちゃんはもう決めたの？　すごいわね。\nどんな演出になるのか、今から楽しみだわ。","zh":"亚利沙，已经决定好了吗？真厉害啊。\n会变成什么样的演出呢，现在就很期待。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ee64d34dc5c0b40e2161d22b6f02e31258c13297e7a18ab1260813760bd1ed46","ja":"私はどんなふうにアピールしようかしら。\n私らしさ……となると、やっぱり……。","zh":"我该怎么展现自己呢。\n说到我的风格……果然。。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"6bfbbb8d7082c13e4f2ee993ce73cd444fa1fa0b88ab701fb829faeb24db4001","ja":"「では、それぞれ別室でセルフプロデュースを\n考えて下さい！　制限時間は1時間です！」","zh":"「那么，请各自到不同房间构思自我企划！\n限时1小时！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"db3863fa9299f271cbfb74f37a90d621a7721d57a7e789e53f4979d0a3e0590c","ja":"そして1時間後……","zh":"然后过了1小时……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:06:06+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"8c8c9205e6fcaa6d9d9b3e3c3f09f2dcb84d9bda9dcdb75b43bae0204229243a","ja":"「どうです？　しっかり演出を考えられましたか？」","zh":"「怎么样？演出想好了吗？」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"6e769c42c46a77489018a633c3858ec9649d31d267c24681e5a8645b08fe4f82","ja":"まあ、アタシなりに考えられたかな。\nそんなに、特別なことするわけじゃないけど。","zh":"嗯，算是按我的风格想出来了吧。\n不过，也没打算做什么特别的事就是了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"7f5018f906cb7456e222ec25b54218bc5c2a9add52e56dc9178d4c38e153fa46","ja":"「それでは、最初は所恵美さんに\n歌っていただきましょう！　どうぞー！」","zh":"「那么，首先请所惠美先生来\n为我们演唱！有请——！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"673a0fc154da7bb02777f25d4ea253be763611b545141a7235ecdb2779b61568","ja":"みんな～！　アタシと一緒に、楽しく歌おっ！\nリズムに合わせて、手拍子もよろしくねっ♪","zh":"大家～！和我一起开心唱歌吧！\n请跟着节奏拍手哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"7fadd298b5892814f18f6c3cf80e317f1adfb02cf501ac0f20dd4c428743c8fa","ja":"なるほど……観覧客やスタッフさんに合いの手を\r\n入れてもらったり、一緒に歌ったりするんですね。","zh":"原来如此……让观众和工作人员帮忙应和，  \n还会一起唱歌呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"96583bc0cc069de5790a481d4ca5006be12fbd950bffdb13bd0dbf8674123440","ja":"ふふっ。スタジオなのに、お友達とカラオケで\n歌ってるみたいで、とっても楽しいね♪","zh":"呵呵。明明是录音室，却像和朋友一起\n在卡拉OK唱歌一样，好开心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1079300","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1828.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"5fc5799fe49e2f55624c43cf6b727f37604f682f477bf1c2dae2d0adc07481fc","ja":"観客も、一体感を味わえてて楽しそうだ。\n最初から手ごわいな。","zh":"观众也能感受到一体感，看起来很开心。\n从一开始就很棘手。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-11-26T06:25:00+00:00"}
